# steps/named-struct-exec.md §12: unit_named_struct_exec_ctl_method under the knob --walk-methods: run and
# Counter's procedure walked -- run's bare `Counter` is a CALL of the procedure over Counter, whose while,
# if, for, call and return in a block run as a walked method's: n 10, seen 8.  Entry 7.
size_t: seen 0U
fn: put (size_t: a) int
    seen: seen + a
return: 0
Counter:
    size_t: n 0U
    size_t: k 0U
    while: k < 5U
        n: n + 1U
        k: k + 1U
    if: n = 5U
        n: n + 2U
    else:
        n: 100U
    for: int(i, 0) (i < 3) i++
        n: n + 1U
    end: for
    put: 4U
    if: n = 10U
        return
    n: 100U
return
fn: run () size_t
    Counter
    Counter
    size_t: v 9U
    v: Counter\n
return: v
size_t: got 9U
got: run()
int: ok 0
if: got = 10U && seen = 8U
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
